			"Message": "style(Common): Add consistent blank lines after type and impl definitions\n\nApply uniform formatting across the Transport and IPC modules by inserting blank lines after struct, enum, trait, and impl block declarations. This improves readability and maintains consistent visual separation between type definitions and their implementations.\n\nAffected modules: CircuitBreaker, Correlation, Metrics, Registry, Retry, EstablishHostConnection, ProxyCallToSideCar. All changes are whitespace-only with no functional modifications.",
